WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.164 --> 00:00:15.830
It was early in the morning and still dark outside.

2
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.111
A garbage truck drove along West Street.

3
00:00:21.292 --> 00:00:23.753
Suddenly bolts of electricity lit up the sky.

4
00:00:24.753 --> 00:00:26.434
Za-wap! Za-wap!

5
00:00:28.915 --> 00:00:30.756
A second later the sky was dark again.

6
00:00:31.724 --> 00:00:34.225
"That was strange," said one garbageman.

7
00:00:34.245 --> 00:00:36.666
"Yeah," said the other man.

8
00:00:36.686 --> 00:00:40.848
"I wonder what Oh no!"

9
00:00:42.388 --> 00:00:48.671
Roar! "I'm so glad it's Friday," said Jack.

10
00:00:49.631 --> 00:00:50.892
"No school tomorrow!"

11
00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:55.294
Roxy and her friends were walking to school.

12
00:00:56.194 --> 00:00:57.835
Everyone was excited about the weekend.

13
00:00:57.855 --> 00:01:01.557
"We should go to the park tomorrow," said Terrell.

14
00:01:01.577 --> 00:01:04.259
"Great idea," said Roxy.

15
00:01:04.279 --> 00:01:06.601
"Let's ride our bikes there."

16
00:01:06.621 --> 00:01:09.283
"I'll bring a Frisbee," said Jack.

17
00:01:09.303 --> 00:01:12.005
"We can play Frisbee tag."

18
00:01:15.248 --> 00:01:16.029
Mara sighed.

19
00:01:16.049 --> 00:01:19.011
"I wish I could go with you," she said.

20
00:01:19.031 --> 00:01:21.733
"But my parents made plans already.

21
00:01:22.694 --> 00:01:26.017
They're taking me to the Metro City Natural History Museum."

22
00:01:27.158 --> 00:01:29.300
"I love that museum," said Terrell.

23
00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.262
"It has ancient fossils and cave paintings.

24
00:01:34.002 --> 00:01:35.743
And lots of dinosaur bones!"

25
00:01:37.444 --> 00:01:39.845
"Dinosaurs are awesome," said Jack.

26
00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.826
"My favorite is T.

27
00:01:41.926 --> 00:01:44.548
rex." Mara's eyes lit up.

28
00:01:44.568 --> 00:01:48.070
"Hey! Why don't you all come with me?"

29
00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.311
"Really?" said Roxy.

30
00:01:50.331 --> 00:01:52.372
"Sure," said Mara.

31
00:01:52.392 --> 00:01:54.173
"My parents won't mind."

32
00:01:55.494 --> 00:01:56.794
Roxy and her friends grinned.

33
00:01:56.814 --> 00:01:58.475
"I can't wait!"

34
00:01:58.776 --> 00:01:59.356
said Jack.

35
00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:01.257
"Maybe we'll see a T.

36
00:02:01.377 --> 00:02:02.278
rex skeleton!"

37
00:02:03.339 --> 00:02:06.822
"I wish we could see real live dinosaurs," said Terrell.

38
00:02:06.842 --> 00:02:09.325
"It's too bad they're extinct."

39
00:02:12.007 --> 00:02:15.050
"You can see live dinosaurs, Terrell," said Roxy.

40
00:02:16.071 --> 00:02:18.133
"You just need to invent a time machine."

41
00:02:20.375 --> 00:02:22.877
"Ha-ha." Terrell pretended to laugh.

42
00:02:24.579 --> 00:02:25.840
But then he looked excited.

43
00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:32.842
"Hey! Maybe Rocket Girl could help us build a time machine!"

44
00:02:34.523 --> 00:02:35.984
Roxy laughed and shook her head.

45
00:02:36.004 --> 00:02:39.466
"Terrell, that's ridiculous.

46
00:02:40.387 --> 00:02:43.369
I doubt Rocket Girl knows how to build a time machine."

47
00:02:44.389 --> 00:02:45.290
Terrell sighed.

48
00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.391
"You're probably right."

49
00:02:48.672 --> 00:02:50.313
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:54.456
"Oh!" she said, looking at her friends.

51
00:02:55.556 --> 00:02:59.817
"I just realized I um forgot my pencil box.

52
00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:01.558
I'll see you at school!"

53
00:03:03.498 --> 00:03:06.039
"Wait!" called Terrell as Roxy hurried away.

54
00:03:06.059 --> 00:03:08.880
"You can borrow one of my pencils!"

55
00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.221
But Roxy was already gone.

56
00:03:12.281 --> 00:03:14.782
She went around the corner and made sure nobody was nearby.

57
00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:18.083
She pressed a button on her watch.

58
00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:20.823
Mayor Bloom's face appeared on the screen.

59
00:03:21.784 --> 00:03:22.524
He looked nervous.

60
00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:24.960
"Mayor Bloom, what's wrong?"

61
00:03:25.261 --> 00:03:25.881
asked Roxy.

62
00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:29.602
"Metro City needs your help, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

63
00:03:29.622 --> 00:03:33.903
"Dinosaurs are roaming all over downtown Metro City!"

64
00:03:33.923 --> 00:03:38.244
"But dinosaurs are extinct," said Roxy, confused.

65
00:03:38.264 --> 00:03:40.965
"These dinosaurs aren't!"

66
00:03:41.265 --> 00:03:41.865
said the mayor.

67
00:03:41.885 --> 00:03:44.366
"Now please, help!"

68
00:03:44.386 --> 00:03:47.207
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Roxy.

69
00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:48.868
"I'm on my way!"
